<title>JAPAN: Kyowa Exeo to issue 10 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Kyowa Exeo to issue 10 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Kyowa Exeo Corp</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Fuji Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   3	  AMT   10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 29.Mar.02</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 1.Aug.97   CONV TO 28.Mar.02</p>
<p> LAST MOODY's	   PAY DATE 25.Jun.97  INT PAY 31.Mar</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 18.Jun-24.Jun</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on June 17.</p>
</text>
